er, this design is a timeless choice for any bachelor celebration. Its understated elegance makes it suitable for both intimate gatherings and larger pre-wedding parties.','Elegant cream textured cake with fondant tuxedo front, black bow tie and mustache topper',699,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1781268352/blissbakery/products/et8r28l8v2fpovqxls1g.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"special-milestones\"]','[\"groom-to-be\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-12 12:54:57.999','2026-06-12 12:54:57.999','[\"Chocochips\",\"Hazelnut\",\"Nutella\",\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"Almond Truffle\",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]',NULL,450,249,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Strawberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Kesar Pista\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"price500g\":550}]','CUSTOM','Blueberry',NULL),('grm_09','Ivory Gold Tuxedo Boutonniere Cake','ivory-gold-tuxedo-boutonniere-cake','A truly exquisite groom-to-be cake that doubles as a work of art. This tall cake is wrapped in smooth ivory fondant with blush pink tuxedo lapels, three gold buttons, a stunning oversized gold fondant bow tie and a delicate fondant boutonniere flower. Finished with a gold ribbon around the base, every detail speaks luxury and refinement. Perfect for upscale bachelor dinners, engagement celebrations and groom showers.','Premium tall ivory fondant cake with blush lapels, gold bow tie, buttons and boutonniere',1449,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1781268353/blissbakery/products/iciqjyyghjfuou9xypdm.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"special-milestones\"]','[\"groom-to-be\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-12 12:54:57.999','2026-06-12 12:54:57.999','[\"Chocochips\",\"Hazelnut\",\"Nutella\",\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"Almond Truffle\",\"Truffle Dutch\",\"Butterscotch\",\"Salted Caramel\",\"Red Velvet\",\"Pineapple\",\"Blueberry\",\"Strawberry\",\"Kesar Pista\",\"Rose\"]',NULL,450,549,'[{\"name\":\"Chocochips\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Hazelnut\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Nutella\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Belgian Chocolate\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Almond Truffle\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Truffle Dutch\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Butterscotch\",\"price500g\":550},{\"name\":\"Salted Caramel\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Red Velvet\",\"price500g\":600},{\"name\":\"Pineapple\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Blueberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Strawberry\",\"price500g\":450},{\"name\":\"Kesar Pista\",\"price500g\":650},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"price500g\":550}]','CUSTOM','Blueberry',NULL),('grm_10','Groom To Be Couple Leash Cake','groom-to-be-couple-leash-cake','A fun and lively groom-to-be tall cake with a smooth cream base decorated with a charming illustrated couple where the bride leads the groom on a playful leash. Gold pearl sprinkles cascade around the top, with a crisp black ribbon and bow at the base and an elegant black Groom to Be script topper. This design balances humour with style, making it perfect for fun-loving bachelor parties and pre-wedding celebrations.','Tall cream cake with illustrated couple, gold pearls, black ribbon and Groom to Be topper',1299,NULL,'[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dvw9o0f8z/image/upload/v1781268354/blissbakery/products/phwxvf0attbwzz1dpn0z.jpg\"]',0,0,0,1,NULL,'[\"special-milestones\"]','[\"groom-to-be\"]',NULL,'cmq2aide00001pvoou1f9tqu7','2026-06-12